	}
```

**Summary:** `s3presign.Runner` runs once at startup and then every 12 hours, refreshing S3 presigned URLs before they expire (5-day TTL, refresh when less than ~1 day of validity remains). It is wired in `Server.startBackgroundRunners()`, invoked from `Server.Start()` during process startup in `cmd/memos/main.go`.

